@api = https://api.cyclocity.fr
@contract = lyon
@client_token = A_REMPLIR
@identity = A_REMPLIR
@account_id = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@subscription_id = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@station_id = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@bike_id = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@station_number = 0
@stand_number = 0
@bike_number = 0
@email_encoded = utilisateur%40example.com

### Jeton applicatif public. Vérifié le 28 octobre 2026.
POST {{api}}/auth/environments/PRD/client_tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "vls.web.lyon:PRD",
  "key": "c3d9f5c22a9157a7cc7fe0e38269573bdd2f13ec48f867360ecdcbd35b196f87"
}

### Découverte de la connexion personnelle.
GET https://iam.cyclocity.fr/realms/vls-default/.well-known/openid-configuration

### Résolution du compte après la connexion OIDC. Issue des captures publiées.
GET {{api}}/contracts/{{contract}}/accounts/{{email_encoded}}/id
Authorization: Taknv1 {{client_token}}
Identity: {{identity}}
Accept: application/json

### Profil.
GET {{api}}/contracts/{{contract}}/accounts/{{account_id}}
Authorization: Taknv1 {{client_token}}
Identity: {{identity}}
Accept: application/vnd.account.v4+json

### Points.
GET {{api}}/contracts/{{contract}}/accounts/{{account_id}}/rewards
Authorization: Taknv1 {{client_token}}
Identity: {{identity}}
Accept: application/vnd.rewards.v5+json

### Historique des points.
GET {{api}}/contracts/{{contract}}/accounts/{{account_id}}/rewards/history?page=0
Authorization: Taknv1 {{client_token}}
Identity: {{identity}}
Accept: application/vnd.rewards.v5+json

### Règles publiques de fidélité. Vérifié le 28 octobre 2026.
GET {{api}}/contracts/{{contract}}/rewards/configurations
Authorization: Taknv1 {{client_token}}
Accept: application/vnd.rewards.v5+json

### Abonnements permettant la location. À valider avec le compte.
GET {{api}}/contracts/{{contract}}/accounts/{{account_id}}/subscriptions?periods=CURRENT&typeList=ST&typeList=LT&isLocked=false
Authorization: Taknv1 {{client_token}}
Identity: {{identity}}
Accept: application/vnd.subscription.v6+json

### Station.
GET {{api}}/contracts/{{contract}}/stations/{{station_number}}
Authorization: Taknv1 {{client_token}}
Accept: application/vnd.station.v4+json

### Vélos. Cette route reçoit actuellement 403 dans l'environnement d'enquête.
GET {{api}}/contracts/{{contract}}/bikes?stationNumber={{station_number}}
Authorization: Taknv1 {{client_token}}
Accept: application/vnd.bikes.v4+json

### Réservations en cours.
GET {{api}}/contracts/{{contract}}/accounts/{{account_id}}/bookings
Authorization: Taknv1 {{client_token}}
Identity: {{identity}}

### Trajets en cours.
GET {{api}}/contracts/{{contract}}/accounts/{{account_id}}/trips/ongoing
Authorization: Taknv1 {{client_token}}
Identity: {{identity}}
Accept: application/vnd.trip.v6+json

### Historique des trajets.
GET {{api}}/contracts/{{contract}}/accounts/{{account_id}}/trips?status=FINISHED&status=ERROR&status=REVERSED
Authorization: Taknv1 {{client_token}}
Identity: {{identity}}
Accept: application/vnd.trip.v6+json

### Validité du paiement.
GET {{api}}/contracts/{{contract}}/accounts/{{account_id}}/payment
Authorization: Taknv1 {{client_token}}
Identity: {{identity}}
Accept: application/vnd.payment.v3+json

### Carte publique sans jeton. Vérifié le 28 octobre 2026.
GET {{api}}/contracts/{{contract}}/gbfs/v3/station_status.json

### Mutation. Réserver consomme des points et immobilise le vélo. Corps Android rapporté.
POST {{api}}/contracts/{{contract}}/accounts/{{account_id}}/bookings
Authorization: Taknv1 {{client_token}}
Identity: {{identity}}
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "stationId": "{{station_id}}",
  "stationNumber": {{station_number}},
  "standNumber": {{stand_number}},
  "subscriptionId": "{{subscription_id}}",
  "bikeId": "{{bike_id}}"
}

### Mutation. Libérer un vélo en étant présent à la station. Capture publiée, non exécutée ici.
POST {{api}}/contracts/{{contract}}/accounts/{{account_id}}/subscriptions/{{subscription_id}}/trips
Authorization: Taknv1 {{client_token}}
Identity: {{identity}}
Content-Type: application/vnd.trip.v6+json

{
  "stationNumber": {{station_number}},
  "standNumber": {{stand_number}},
  "bikeNumber": {{bike_number}},
  "typeFrom": "SMARTPHONE"
}

### Mutation. Régler l'utilisation automatique des points. Capture publiée, non exécutée ici.
PATCH {{api}}/contracts/{{contract}}/accounts/{{account_id}}/rewards
Authorization: Taknv1 {{client_token}}
Identity: {{identity}}
Content-Type: application/vnd.rewards.v5+json

{
  "autoSpend": false
}
